        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7001, Modern 1-1/4 Inch Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in a huge selection of finish colors, this small contemporary styled floor mounted door stop is 1-1/4 inches high. The 1-1/4 Inch Modern Door Stop is easy to install with a single center mounting point. Packaged with mounting anchor and screw.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/1-1-4-inch-stainless-steel-modern-door-stop-omnia-7001-us32d\"><b>1-1/4\" Stainless Steel Door Stop</b></a> and a taller <a href=\"/products/1-3-4-inch-modern-door-stop-omnia-7000\"><b>1-3/4\" Door Stop</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 7001 Modern Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 1-1/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Height to Rubber Bumper Center: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper: Black</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
